      "answer": {
        "lead": "Not on your manager's say-so alone: 1 June to 10 July 2027 in Portland is 40 calendar days, so it needs HR review.",
        "policy_facts": [
          {
            "text": "Working from a family home counts as temporary remote work. Portland, OR is another US state from your Seattle, WA base.",
